                                "sense_id": "44b1a5b6-679d-3e5b-b46c-7aa86cd91acd",
                                "text": "Then there are the phobes whose fear of birds is combined with a fear of feathers, pteronophobia.\nOne case of bird-and-feathers phobia involved a woman in her thirties who was too frightened to go outside."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d13ef01-a576-4bbb-978a-5d8ec4c2d6fd",
                                "sense_id": "44b1a5b6-679d-3e5b-b46c-7aa86cd91acd",
                                "text": "It is easy, for example, for a person to live with pteronophobia, aulophobia, or batrachophobia. One simply stays away from feathers, flutes, and frogs!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7efed1f9-fd1d-40f2-bc36-9c068bf8b445",
                                "sense_id": "44b1a5b6-679d-3e5b-b46c-7aa86cd91acd",
                                "text": "'Um ... pteronophobia is the fear of being tickled with feathers, I think . . . '"
